294
00:18:42,180 --> 00:18:44,900
What's wrong, Bergmann?

295
00:18:45,480 --> 00:18:47,200
Alright, go on, Bergmann!

296
00:18:53,400 --> 00:18:55,800
The salto is... dah!

297
00:19:12,440 --> 00:19:14,580
We did it! We pinned him down!

298
00:19:15,100 --> 00:19:17,560
Alright, good job, Bergmann!

299
00:19:17,660 --> 00:19:20,320
Hahaha, thank you very much, Chief!

300
00:19:22,500 --> 00:19:24,280
Good job, Bergmann.

301
00:19:24,280 --> 00:19:25,200
Good boy, good boy, good boy.

302
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:29,800
This dog...

303
00:19:30,480 --> 00:19:31,440
