304
00:19:32,920 --> 00:19:33,940
Sure enough...

305
00:19:34,360 --> 00:19:36,680
Chief, this dog is Bergmann!

306
00:19:36,680 --> 00:19:37,240
What?

307
00:19:37,240 --> 00:19:40,740
Then the one we just had brought in,

308
00:19:41,420 --> 00:19:42,140
Chief...

309
00:19:42,140 --> 00:19:43,600
It's Ryo-chan!

310
00:19:43,600 --> 00:19:47,300
