320
00:20:15,520 --> 00:20:16,460
And Bergmann?

321
00:20:17,460 --> 00:20:18,460
No, no!

322
00:20:20,540 --> 00:20:22,480
Senpai,
are we really going to try to pull this off?

323
00:20:22,480 --> 00:20:24,100
Ryo-chan, it's already busted!

324
00:20:24,100 --> 00:20:28,020
Wait, this looks interesting.
Let's keep him at it.

325
00:20:30,440 --> 00:20:31,568
Alright, Ryotsu,

326
00:20:31,618 --> 00:20:36,500
