357
00:21:59,820 --> 00:22:03,760
Just go! Or what, is that Bergmann a fake?

358
00:22:03,760 --> 00:22:06,520
No, of course not.
I'll send him in right away.

359
00:22:07,380 --> 00:22:09,340
Damn it, I knew it would come to this.

360
00:22:09,700 --> 00:22:11,900
Listen, Bergmann,
