371
00:22:40,000 --> 00:22:42,000
You suddenly vanished from Kajiba...

372
00:22:42,000 --> 00:22:43,240
We were worried about you, you know.

373
00:22:44,220 --> 00:22:45,060
There, there.

374
00:22:46,620 --> 00:22:47,480
Were you worried?

375
00:22:47,480 --> 00:22:50,100
Well, of course, Bergmann and I

376
